        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "We brought our cat here for the first time to get shaved down.\nThe cut is very even all over and he is well trimmed at his bum, where the problem was.\nSuper happy with the results!\nThere’s parking right next to the building, I should have asked before I went.",
        "time": 1702408165,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Isabelle Menarik",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107622063605724163985/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUtPuOOPGMpIVs4NkXs9tT2es8w78anH7z2aK8DSNWRoCCvQQs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "I brought my cat Ellie to be groomed here after moving away from my previous groomer. She gets extremely tense and can give groomers a hard time, which I communicated before the appointment. I dropped her off (typically I stay in the room while they’re grooming her to comfort her) but they said it wasn’t necessary. I was told to come back in 45 mins. When I arrived after 45 minutes I was told they were not able to groom her. She has been sitting in her cat carrier, stressed for 45 minutes when I was just down the street in my car waiting for a call or to go back at the time I was told. I would have really appreciated a quick phone call or text..",
        "time": 1751687780,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nata Maimone",
